WEBVTT

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:48.560
Ga-thunk!

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:52.080
I'll be saving little girls all over the world again today!

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.880
Wow, what a picturesque town!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.760
I've always wanted to visit Lowee.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.850
I had an inkling you felt that way.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.140
Rom and Ram told me to come visit.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:12.230
Apparently Blanc doesn't let them leave the country.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.690
Yeah, Blanc can be a real party pooper sometimes.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:20.160
Someone should tell her she'll end up as a loner like Noire if she keeps that up.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.740
Hello? Did you forget I was right here?

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.790
Wait!

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:24.790
Who are you calling a loner?!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.410
My bad!

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.500
But hey, someone laying it on you straight like that

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.210
might give you the little push you need to change yourself!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.630
Big words coming from Goddess Lazybones herself!

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.170
Maybe it was a mistake to come here after all.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.350
She fell for it!

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.110
It worked...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.980
Rom, Ram!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.610
What do you think you're doing?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.110
Run for it!

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.030
Wait!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.620
Are you certain about this?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.210
Putting this plan into action

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.630
will bring revolution to this world.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.380
I'm aware.
Hold it right there!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:14.670
Help!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.090
We definitely need to keep this under wraps until we begin.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.380
Rom! Ram!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.140
Run for it!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:26.010
You lot...

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.020
How many times do I gotta tell ya to keep it down when I'm tryin' to work?!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.560
I-I'm so sorry!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.560
Sis...

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.190
Lookie look!

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:37.690
Huh?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.320
What the...?!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.860
It's you!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.700
Ram and I drew it!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.620
My precious book...

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.370
You two are <i>dead!</i>

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.620
Look, the drawing came to life!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.290
Hold it right there!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.550
Run for it!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.180
Nepgear! Uni!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.760
You came!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.800
Yup! We came to play!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.810
Heyo, Blanc!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.100
I came for you!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.020
Teehee.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.350
So, like... yeah!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:19.150
We heard Lowee had this brand spanking new amusement park,

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.650
so we all decided to
come and take a look-see!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:27.530
Histoire contacted me and said she wanted me to teach you what it meant to be a CPU, though.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.240
Aw, don't bother your pretty head with that!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.960
It was all in one ear and out the other last time, y'know?

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.920
Well, <i>excuse</i> me.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.710
I've heard about the amusement park too.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.010
Wouldn't it be fun if we all went there together?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.970
Super Nitten Land?!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.550
I wanna go!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.680
Take us there! I can't wait!

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.190
Could you take my sisters along?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:55.850
What about you?

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:56.810
Sis...

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:57.940
Aren't you coming?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.480
I... can't.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.400
What? More work?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.030
Why don't you just quit already?

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.070
The wise men of the past once said,

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:09.030
"Only fools and horses work."

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.450
I don't think those men were all that wise.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.120
Either way,

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.460
I can't go.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.600
Wait for me, Ram!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.010
Put on your coats, you two!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.020
You're forgetting the tickets, Nepgear!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.070
Nepgear!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.440
Uni!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.610
Where'd you go?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.530
Here!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.910
Right here!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.160
A Dogoo coin!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.410
This one's got a Kupocat!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.750
Ah, it's just a Tertis block.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.550
And this one's a Tesrit.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.340
Lame!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.890
I'll take some!

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.930
Other nations' CPUs have come all the way, you know.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.020
Blanc should've come along.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.060
I seriously don't understand
what goes through her head.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:22.860
Indeed. What she needs is a little maturity.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.320
Like me.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.320
Oh yeah, why are you here—

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.780
Zoinks!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.830
This turtle's after my peaches!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.160
Nooo!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.540
Someone help!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.540
Zoinks!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.760
Look, Rom! It's a Guardragon coin!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:48.010
A rare item!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.550
That one too.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.260
Oh, and that one too!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.800
They're all Guardragons!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:56.140
But, uh, I think I've had enough.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.640
Let's take some back for Sis.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.810
Why bother?

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.810
Not like <i>she</i> bothered coming.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.820
Yeah, but...

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.150
Fine.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.160
Let's take a whole lot back for Sis.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.700
Okay!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.660
Yay!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.300
Lick!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.590
Huh?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.720
What's up, Nepgear?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.810
Where did Rom and Ram run off to?

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:39.020
I saw them go that way earlier.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.940
Rom?

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.650
Ram?

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.820
Ah-kekekekeke!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.570
Rom! Ram!

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.570
What's the meaning of this?!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.130
Post-pubescent hags need not apply!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.880
Looks like it went off without a hitch, Trick.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:11.340
Our delicious banquet of fun
has only just begun!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.270
Rom...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.350
Ram!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.110
I'm extremely sorry.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:31.320
Blanc gave me specific orders not to allow anyone through.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:35.110
What's the big deal? We're all buddy-buddy CPUs, right?

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.620
I can't. I'm sorry.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.740
At least let us apologize!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:43.370
It's our fault Rom and Ram got kidnapped!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.880
We've already mobilized the guard and sent them out to look for them.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.340
We know that!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.420
Leave.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:54.010
You guys are always causing trouble.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.270
Rom...

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.020
Ram...

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.650
It's all my fault.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:12.400
I'm your sister...

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.530
If only I'd been

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.030
more responsible...

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.790
I've gotta do something. Anything.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.920
Oh, yeah. That—

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.920
Ga-thunk!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.670
Found you!

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.140
Who're you?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.890
I'm Abnes!

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.640
Ally of little girls everywhere!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.600
I'm the anchor of Abnes Channel, a super-hit web show.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.980
Don't you recognize me?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.270
Come now, let's get this broadcast started!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:53.360
Broadcast?

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.110
Hello to all our viewers across the world!

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:01.740
This is Abnes, idol to little girls everywhere!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:05.870
Today, we're here to visit Blanc, Lowee's little girl CPU!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.620
Hey, knock it the hell off before I—

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:14.630
By the way, is it true that Rom and Ram, your little sisters, got kidnapped?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.130
How'd you know?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.930
It <i>is</i> true!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.180
I'm so worried!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:26.140
So, Blanc, how does it feel to have your precious little sisters snatched away from you?

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.400
Good heavens, that Blanc.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.820
This is an emergency! Why does she have to keep up that stubborn facade?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:38.400
Yeah, that's supposed to be <i>your</i> shtick, Noire.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.160
Excuse me?!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.320
Um, ladies...

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.160
In truth—

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.660
Sis, what's going on up there?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:57.380
Well then, Blanc, are you saying it's all your fault your sisters got kidnapped?

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.420
Well...

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.470
Get a load of this!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.640
The little girl CPU can't say anything at all in her own defense!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.220
Little girls just aren't cut out to rule a nation, after all.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.440
They should be living carefree lives full of fun and games!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.480
Abnes Channel stands wholly opposed to little girls playing CPU!

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.480
Hey! What's going on here?!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.610
Who are you?

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.820
I'm Neptune!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.610
Planeptune's CPU!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.070
<i>You're</i> a CPU too?

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:29.250
I guess you technically look old enough to be a teenager,

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.210
but your body's too underdeveloped!

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.460
You're a little girl!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.840
Certified!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.510
Wha? Did I really just get certified as a little girl by an even littler girl?

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.300
Huh? In what way am I a little girl?

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.510
It takes one to know one, you know!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.390
So that means you <i>are</i> a little girl!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.060
You're the one who's calling people little girls left and right!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.060
Did you just call me a little girl <i>again</i>?!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.350
Hold it right there!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.820
I'll let you off the hook for today,

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.860
little girl CPU!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.360
Say what, pintsize?!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.070
Yeah, get outta here, little girl!

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.200
Your face makes me wanna hurl!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.700
What in Gamindustri was that?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.120
I wonder how they got in.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.210
Blanc!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.750
Pull yourself together!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.920
I-I'll go get help!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.380
What's wrong?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.510
What if lots of Lowee's residents saw that broadcast just now?

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.510
Maybe it caused her Shares to crash or something.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:31.520
Oh, yeah. CPUs can't use much energy when their Share reserves are low.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.640
I don't think this has anything to do with Shares.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:36.440
Public opinion can't be swayed that quickly.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:37.400
Then...

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.270
Ladies.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.030
There's still something we can do.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:46.030
I know how we can find Rom and Ram.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:51.200
Blanc and I were trying to put a certain plan into action.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:59.710
You're aware Lowee used to offer a satellite imagery service, yes?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:03.380
If I remember correctly, it was called Terra View, wasn't it?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.880
The one that was closed down around a decade ago, right?

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:06.720
Yes.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:10.640
That satellite's still functioning, actually.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.560
It can still take and send pictures of the surface.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.690
They're pretty low-resolution, though.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.520
Leanbox's research institute developed software that could analyze the data

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.490
and produce images of a much higher resolution.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.950
Wow. Your country's crazy advanced!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.450
And so I made Blanc an offer.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:35.710
I said we'd let her have this software if she provided us with photographic data of Lowee.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.460
What?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:40.670
That means that you two would have data on the whole world to yourselves!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:44.210
Huh? Having you peeking at us all day would be no fun at all!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:49.970
No, we were thinking of sharing this information with everyone.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.270
It was Blanc's idea.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:58.730
"We signed a treaty of friendship, so all four nations should have equal access."

00:13:58.730 --> 00:13:59.940
Really?

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:03.690
So we were looking for a good opportunity to announce it.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.530
A bit like a surprise present.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.740
Pretty nice, eh?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.370
Analysis complete.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.330
Time to find out where the kidnapper's hiding.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.000
Oh my.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.410
Is this...

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.130
Lickety lickety lick...

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.260
No!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.470
Rom?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.220
The little girls awaken! It's happening!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.680
Can I lick you two all over?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.770
What do you think you're doing to Rom?!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.520
Stop it!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.570
N-No!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.070
Stop!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.240
Trick!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.950
I called them and delivered our ransom demands.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.330
Wait, what are you doing?!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.710
Healing them, of course!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:04.090
My saliva is a miraculous panacea that cures any ill!

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.750
Th-That so?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:10.090
I'll have you two feeling better lickety-split!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.180
Who would've thought they'd be hiding within a ride that was under construction?

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.060
All right, time to crash this party!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.230
Hold on.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.100
What's up?

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:23.610
In situations like these, you need to make sure the hostages are safe first.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.320
No!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.440
Stop!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.490
Let us go!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.490
That's quite enough!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.490
Sis?

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.740
Who's that? Another delicious young morsel?

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.910
Vert!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.160
Let those girls go.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.040
I'll take their place!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:45.960
Huh?

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.340
I'm a gentleman, you know.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.470
I only like little girls.

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:51.550
I've no interest in those cancerous growths on your chest.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.640
Wh-What's wrong with being well-endowed?

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.640
All I can see is how much
they'll sag one day.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:03.940
Looks like you've managed to anger me.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:14.240
Y-You're a CPU?!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.670
Green Heart,

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.040
transformation complete.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.210
Oh, shit!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.550
Screw the ransom, our
lives are in danger here!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:45.190
Kekekeke! Did you seriously think you had me licked?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:47.940
We'll see about that.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.150
Have a taste of this Drill Lance!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.490
Rainy Ratnapura!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.540
Nooo!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.120
That was easy.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:05.870
Oh?

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.920
Where are Rom and Ram?

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.180
Crud, CPUs!

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.130
Sis!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:17.390
She was in on it too!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.510
Got it.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.600
How dare you think you can make a fool out of us?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.980
Oh, that was just Trick.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:29.610
Also, we only carried out this whole kidnapping deal because some weird woman put us up to it.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.070
Hm?

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.360
Sounds like just the kind of thing an underling would say.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.070
Y-Yeah!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:37.660
I'm just a plain ol' underling.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.620
So, I'll be taking my leave now.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.490
Did you think it'd be that easy?!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.660
Lace Ribbon Dance!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.000
Not happening, huh?

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:55.260
I'll keep these little girls safe,
even if it should cost me my life!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.470
That is my duty as a gentleman!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.640
Where are you,
my delicate flower buds?

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.890
What spirit!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.940
Little girls really are the best!

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.400
Lickety lickety lick!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.610
Get your filthy tongue off my precious little sisters.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:20.910
You'll pay for this,

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.540
ya frickin' pedo.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.910
Pedo?

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.040
My, you flatter me!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.580
Oh, really?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.170
Then let me flatten you as well.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.440
I hope you're ready,

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.810
ya stinkin' pedo!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.240
You damn deviant!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.330
Sleazebag!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.920
Tanzerin Trombe!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.760
Little girls forever!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.930
You picked a fight with a goddess.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.810
Don't come crying to me later.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.600
Rom.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.900
Ram.

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:36.860
Sorry for putting you through this.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:42.030
I'm a failure as a sister.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.870
Sis!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:46.990
We brought you these.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.620
Guardragon coins!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.800
Get out here, kidnapper!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.140
I'll smash you all the way to Planeptune!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.180
Sis...

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:11.100
Maybe it's all over already.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.240
Whaat?!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.240
Lack of sleep?

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.620
Yeah.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.120
That's why I lost consciousness,

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.410
and why I didn't go out with you.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.750
What the heck?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.920
I've been pulling all-nighters for a while now,

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.960
so I was in no state to face you guys.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:43.930
And yet you saved Rom and Ram. Thank you so much.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.760
Vert. Noire.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.100
You too, Neptune.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.020
Thanks for sticking up for me during that broadcast.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.730
Oh, it was no big deal!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:57.150
I just did what anyone would do—
chased that annoying brat away!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.520
Look, Sis.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.280
That's nice.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.530
Ram!

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.490
Stop doodling on those things!

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:11.500
You've got so many copies of the same book.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.910
Doesn't matter if we draw on a few, right?

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.000
It <i>does</i> matter!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.000
How?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.210
W-Well...

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:21.300
That's the story I spent night after night working on!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:25.510
So... They're fanzines, basically?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.720
What?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.930
What's it's about, Uni?

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.220
Apparently, there's a girl who fell from the sky

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:33.810
and a boy born with a special power,

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:35.640
and they save the world together.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.940
Oh, so you're supposed to read this as "destiny"?

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.320
Don't read it at all!

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.440
Amazing!

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.780
The protagonist awakened to a new power!

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:45.530
That's so cool!

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:51.450
Stop reading it!

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:28.340
I've gotta do something. Anything.

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:29.760
Oh, yeah. That—

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:30.630
Ga-thunk!

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.760
Found you!

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:37.270
Oops. Wrong room.

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.980
Hey! Help us!
